pvr_mmu.c, pvr_mmu.h: compiled as C by scripts/build-a04br3-board.py through ../compat (Linux API shim) and ../stub (pvr_device stand-in); the API is implemented on IOKit in ../NativePowerVR.cpp.
pvr_device_info.c: compiled as C by scripts/build-a04br3-board.py through ../stub/devinfo (the pvr_device of the device information, ahead of ../stub) for ../NativePowerVRGpu.cpp, which loads the firmware image's device information with it.
pvr_context.c, pvr_cccb.c, pvr_free_list.c, pvr_hwrt.c, pvr_stream.c, pvr_stream_defs.c, pvr_dump.c and their headers: the job layer, compiled as C by scripts/build-a04br3-board.py through ../compat (Linux API shim, native_powervr_linux_jobs.h) and ../stub; what they call (FW objects, GEM, VM, KCCB/FWCCB, pvr_queue without drm_sched) is implemented in ../NativePowerVRJobs.cpp, which replaces pvr_queue.c and pvr_job.c.
